ta-format":"epodoc","inventor-name":{"name":{"$":"WANG FUZHONG"}}},{"@sequence":"3","@data-format":"epodoc","inventor-name":{"name":{"$":"ZHAO DELIN"}}},{"@sequence":"1","@data-format":"original","inventor-name":{"name":{"$":"ZHAO LIXIN"}}},{"@sequence":"2","@data-format":"original","inventor-name":{"name":{"$":"WANG FUZHONG"}}},{"@sequence":"3","@data-format":"original","inventor-name":{"name":{"$":"ZHAO DELIN"}}}]}},"invention-title":{"$":"Liquid crystal display panel integrated with NFC antenna and manufacturing method of same","@lang":"en"},"references-cited":{"citation":[{"@cited-phase":"national-search-report","@cited-by":"examiner","@sequence":"1","patcit":{"@dnum-type":"publication number","@num":"1","document-id":[{"@document-id-type":"epodoc","doc-number":{"$":"CN101308266"},"date":{"$":"20081119"}},{"@document-id-type":"docdb","country":{"$":"CN"},"doc-number":{"$":"101308266"},"kind":{"$":"A"},"date":{"$":"20081119"}}]},"category":{"$":"X"},"rel-claims":{"$":"1-14"},"rel-passage":{"passage":{"$":"* 说明书第1页第1段-第14页最后1段及附图7-13 *"}}},{"@cited-phase":"national-search-report","@cited-by":"examiner","@sequence":"2","patcit":{"@dnum-type":"publication number","@num":"2","document-id":[{"@document-id-type":"epodoc","doc-number":{"$":"CN103353699"},"date":{"$":"20131016"}},{"@document-id-type":"docdb","country":{"$":"CN"},"doc-number":{"$":"103353699"},"kind":{"$":"A"},"date":{"$":"20131016"}}]},"category":{"$":"A"},"rel-claims":{"$":"1-14"},"rel-passage":{"passage":{"$":"* 全文 *"}}},{"@cited-phase":"national-search-report","@cited-by":"examiner","@sequence":"3","patcit":{"@dnum-type":"publication number","@num":"3","document-id":[{"@document-id-type":"epodoc","doc-number":{"$":"CN104461154"},"date":{"$":"20150325"}},{"@document-id-type":"docdb","country":{"$":"CN"},"doc-number":{"$":"104461154"},"kind":{"$":"A"},"date":{"$":"20150325"}}]},"category":{"$":"A"},"rel-claims":{"$":"1-14"},"rel-passage":{"passage":{"$":"* 全文 *"}}},{"@cited-phase":"national-search-report","@cited-by":"examiner","@sequence":"4","patcit":{"@dnum-type":"publication number","@num":"4","document-id":[{"@document-id-type":"epodoc","doc-number":{"$":"CN204883110"},"date":{"$":"20151216"}},{"@document-id-type":"docdb","country":{"$":"CN"},"doc-number":{"$":"204883110"},"kind":{"$":"U"},"date":{"$":"20151216"}}]},"category":{"$":"R"},"rel-claims":{"$":"1-6"},"rel-passage":{"passage":{"$":"* 权利要求1-6 *"}}}]}},"abstract":[{"@lang":"en","p":{"$":"The invention provides a liquid crystal display panel integrated with NFC antenna. The liquid crystal display panel comprises an upper glass substrate, a lower substrate opposite to the upper glass substrate and the NFC antenna, wherein the NFC antenna is a newly-added walking line or a present walking line on the upper glass substrate and/or the lower glass substrate. The antenna can be directly manufactured from the liquid crystal display panel, so extra cost and production technology complexity cannot be increased and large scale production can be facilitated; antenna functions can be realized via a present ITO line on the panel; and the NFC antenna can be realized without a change of the present panel."}},{"@lang":"ol","p":{"$":"[1]    本发明提供一种集成有NFC天线的液晶显示面板，包括：彼此相对的上玻璃基板和下玻璃基板；NFC天线，所述NFC天线为设置于上玻璃基板和/或下玻璃基板的新增走线或现有走线。本发明直接在液晶显示面板上制作出天线出来，既不会增加额外的成本，也不会增加生产工艺的复杂性，有利于大规模生产；也可利用面板上现有的氧化铟锡线路来实现天线的功能，在不改变现有面板的基础上实现NFC天线。"}}]}}}}